_to_sender.png');background-size:cover;background-position:center center;background-origin:content-box;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:rgba(40, 40, 40,0);min-height:80px;height:130px;width:100%;padding:10px;border:none\" title=\"Thumbnail\"></iframe>\n<sup>Created By: <code>@RP-01?</code></sup>\n<p>Something on this network is stealing data and sneaking it out disguised as ordinary web traffic. You've been handed a packet capture from the affected machine. Buried, a compromised host is quietly shipping stolen data out to a server it shouldn't be talking to. Find the traffic that doesn't belong, figure out what's being smuggled, and piece it back together.</p>\n<p>Submit the flag as <code>deadface{flag_text}</code>.</p>\n</span>\n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <div class=\"row challenge-files text-center pb-3\">\n                \n                  <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 file-button-wrapper d-block\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    \n                    <a\n                        class=\"btn btn-info btn-file mb-1 d-inline-block px-2 w-100 text-truncate\"\n                        href=\"/files/9b9f7055bf5f3987355188c72c51d3a8/PCAP03.pcap?token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxNzM4LCJ0ZWFtX2lkIjo4NDAsImZpbGVfaWQiOjh9.atcdKg.jdTHEOTL5Q8RyTb_aeMfvQmhEaE\"\n                        title=\"PCAP03.pcap\"\n                    >\n                      <i class=\"fas fa-download\"></i>\n                      <small>\n                        PCAP03.pcap\n                      </small>\n                    </a>\n                  </div>\n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n              <p class=\"text-center\">\n                <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> tentatives\n              </p>\n            </template>\n\n            <div class=\"row